OL,3,GNEWSANewport Bus 'crisis' as financial
OL,4,Aproblems delay accounts
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinancial difficulties at Newport's
OL,7,Fcouncil-owned bus operator have delayed
OL,8,Fits annual accounts, while the company
OL,9,Fhas also undergone a major overhaul of
OL,10,Fits board of directors, BBC Wales has
OL,11,Flearned.
OL,13,FNewport Transport missed the deadline
OL,14,Fto file accounts for the year ending
OL,15,FMarch 2025, and faced compulsory
OL,16,Fstrike-off action by Companies House
OL,17,Fbefore the process was suspended
OL,18,Fearlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
