OL,3,GNEWSANewport Bus 'crisis' as financial
OL,4,Aproblems delay accounts
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts latest accounts have yet to be
OL,7,Ffiled and opposition councillors have
OL,8,Fcalled the situation a "crisis" and
OL,9,Fdemanded "transparency" from Newport
OL,10,Fcouncil, its only shareholder.
OL,12,FThe council said it was "fully aware of
OL,13,Fthe financial challenges". Newport
OL,14,FTransport has not responded to requests
OL,15,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
